## Additional Notes on Bible Text Data

This software license applies to the code and software architecture of Bible Pro.
Bible text data, translations, and other content have their own respective licenses:

- Public domain translations (KJV, ASV, WEB) are in the public domain
- Licensed translations require separate licensing agreements
- Morphological and linguistic data may have separate attribution requirements
- See data/README.md for specific licensing information for each dataset

Contributors to this project agree to license their contributions under the MIT License.
